{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-i", "title": "離婁上", "description": "孟子曰：「離婁之明，公輸子之巧，不以規矩，不能成方員：師曠之聰，不以六律，不能正五音；堯舜之道，不以仁政，不能平治天下。今有仁心仁聞而民不被其澤，不可法於後世者，不行先王之道也。\n「故曰，徒善不足以為政，徒法不能以自行。《詩》云：『不愆不忘，率由舊章。』遵先王之法而過者，未之有也。聖人既竭目力焉，繼之以規矩準繩，以為方", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "實", "id": "實"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "誠", "id": "誠"}, {"form": "身", "id": "身"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6840146969966728, "source": "反", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.0819099697950434, "source": "反", "target": "智"}, {"weight": 3.0819099697950434, "source": "反", "target": "敬"}, {"weight": 2.1656192379208883, "source": "反", "target": "求"}, {"weight": 1.9832976811269336, "source": "反", "target": "誠"}, {"weight": 1.2901505005669882, "source": "反", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 3.0819099697950434, "source": "智", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 1.1948403207626634, "source": "樂", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.676444861686879, "source": "樂", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 0.9536782639457755, "source": "義", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.052290552613885, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.34754246037545977, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.9536782639457755, "source": "義", "target": "身"}, {"weight": 1.8291470012996753, "source": "義", "target": "實"}, {"weight": 2.7454377331738304, "source": "義", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 2.2064412324411435, "source": "身", "target": "誠"}, {"weight": 1.1078289437730338, "source": "身", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 0.8846853924588238, "source": "身", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.2709797535787146, "source": "事", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.2901505005669882, "sour